le value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, and in 2025 it landed at 64%. The 2026 year opened short, with January to February 2026 at 45% on the middle of the grids. Grid 23894 had its driest year in 1991, at 71% of normal.</p>"}
